{"id":"41fbe58b4634b50157f31343f2510e8b47457aeb","url":"https://www.leiphone.com/category/ai/YZ0bP2vh94KY45RG.html","title":"91% ≈ 0%？谷歌最新研究，戳破工程 Agent 的高正确率泡沫","site_name":"TopHub","source":"Readhub · AI","byline":null,"excerpt":"41.3% 的设计项跨过安全门槛，复杂工程仍困于约束耦合。","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div>\n                                                <!-- 123 -->\n                        \n                        \n                                                \n                        <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- xhBPeYDbNuuRZkwy -->\n                                                <!-- AI影响因子 -->\n                        <!-- 正文内容 -->\n                        <section data-mpa-action-id=\"mmiwq6ij1i3r\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img alt=\"91% ≈ 0%？谷歌最新研究，戳破工程 Agent 的高正确率泡沫\" data-src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261105/6aec19027bc2e.jpg\" data-ratio=\"0.55\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-type=\"jpeg\" data-w=\"1000\" data-croporisrc=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/XqAicMdcoiafO2QKbqiaKeQpMAJqLicpteG2wfHicp4cqNY4ukiaq8xH2J18CcwdsI8WfeqFicUXD9voR7rhpUzINalloAVuyLCg0v7RGARW3ucSRM/0?wx_fmt=jpeg&from=appmsg\" data-cropselx1=\"0\" data-cropselx2=\"546\" data-cropsely1=\"0\" data-cropsely2=\"307\" data-imgfileid=\"100264843\" data-aistatus=\"1\" src=\"https://static.leiphone.com/uploads/new/images/20261105/6aec19027bc2e.jpg?imageMogr2/quality/90\"></section><section data-pm-slice=\"5 10 []\" data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix4tgk1t7p\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-data-temp-type=\"image\" mpa-data-temp-power-by=\"yiban.io\" data-mpa-template=\"t\" data-mid=\"\"><section><section><span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mmix6wyl1l05\" data-pm-slice=\"0 0 []\"><span leaf=\"\"><span textstyle=\"\">41.3% 的设计项跨过安全门槛，复杂工程仍困于约束耦合。</span></span></span></span></section><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mqgbkegzw9n\"></span><span data-mpa-action-id=\"mpmlbwxl8oz\"></span><span data-lark-record-data=\"{&quot;rootId&quot;:&quot;FdZed